-- ROUND72: COMPACT-LIE LANGEVIN CONNECTION IS BASIS-FREE SKEW ENERGY ZERO
--
-- GEOMETRIC SOURCES
--
-- Brian C. Hall,
-- "Lie Groups, Lie Algebras, and Representations: An Elementary Introduction",
