--
-- Standard compact-Lie geometry:
-- * compact G admits an Ad-invariant inner product / bi-invariant metric;
-- * infinitesimally ad_Z is skew-adjoint,
--
--       <[Z,X],Y> + <X,[Z,Y]> = 0;
